"Personal Non-Commercial Use" means use by a natural person for personal,
educational, research, entertainment, or other non-revenue-generating
purposes. Use by employees of a for-profit organization, even on personal
devices, is NOT Personal Non-Commercial Use.

"Commercial Use" means any use by a company, organization, contractor,
service provider, or any use connected with revenue, paid services,
advertising, subscriptions, support contracts, internal business
operations, customer delivery, paid cloud services, or commercial
products. Internal deployment within a for-profit organization for any
business purpose is Commercial Use regardless of whether a fee is
charged to the end user.

"You" means the individual or entity exercising rights under this License.

"Modify" means any copy, adaptation, derivative work, translation,
port, patch, or any other change to the Software, in whole or in part.

"Distribute" means any conveyance of copies of the Software, modified or
unmodified, to a third party by any means, including but not limited to
physical media, network download, software marketplace, app store,
container image, firmware bundle, or installation package.

"Network Service" means providing functionality to third parties as a
service over a network, whether via API, web UI, remote desktop, CLI,
or any other interface, regardless of whether the third party pays.

"Brand" means the project name "oi_enhancements", the product names
